  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks. Cut cauliflower into small florets.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Set aside to cool slightly. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62872c20201894e8f803011a/step-d500f77b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain and rinse lentils.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Roughly chop parsley leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62872c20201894e8f803011a/step-22ca0120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, roughly mash lentils. Add garlic, parsley, dukkah, the egg, the plain flour, the milk and fine breadcrumbs. Mix well.\n• Using damp hands, roll lentil mixture into small balls (3 per person). Transfer to a plate.\n• Refrigerate for 5 minutes. TIP: Chilling the patties helps them firm up!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62872c20201894e8f803011a/step-c7ae337f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, place a few lentil balls in the pan and flatten with a spatula until 1cm-thick. Cook until golden and cooked through, 2-4 minutes each side (don't flip too early!). Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.\n• Repeat with remaining lentil balls. TIP: Add extra oil if needed to prevent the patties from sticking to the pan!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62872c20201894e8f803011a/step-9bf10c6b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the patties are cooking, combine mixed salad leaves, walnuts and the slightly cooled roasted veggies in a large bowl.\n• Add golden goddess dressing.\n• Toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62872c20201894e8f803011a/step-757d3b11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide dukkah-spiced lentil patties and roast veggie and walnut salad between plates.\n• Crumble fetta cubes over salad.\n• Serve with dill & parsley mayonnaise. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62872c20201894e8f803011a/step-cc868eda.jpg"
    }
  ]
